{"title":"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems\">2008 AMC 12A #6</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8\">2008 AMC 10A #8</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Heather compares the price of a new computer at two different stores. Store <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> offers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/a/87a8787ca8fcdf64f42e938d20fa64f63871646d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> off the sticker price followed by a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/4/ee458a47291ac8c044b4cd9dd5e7f39d442a3b10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" /> rebate, and store <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> offers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/6/96633b73a86b9d9110e1ff824fce08def96ca296.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> off the same sticker price with no rebate. Heather saves <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/a/8ba70f61b1c146935b89c7ae17eb6cd4ca444773.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" /> by buying the computer at store <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> instead of store <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />. What is the sticker price of the computer, in dollars?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/7/417ac0932e78d7ef252b57b18a81fb0508b0af46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 750\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 900\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 1000\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 1050\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 1500$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"460\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let the sticker price be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>The price of the computer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/6/ef6d099d5f69a4de87f46ec265265dff4259e64b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.85x-90$\" width=\"82\" height=\"12\" /> at store <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/7/cd78b4aaa258e3771ae655efb1776b825fd54d2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.75x$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> at store <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Heather saves <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/a/8ba70f61b1c146935b89c7ae17eb6cd4ca444773.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" /> at store <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/8/2085a2ff478c61edba8d43b2dc884524e275998b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.85x-90+15=0.75x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"190\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Solving, we find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/4/824c0e8cd623aa15f8d266b0ed75280d1b5a113d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=750$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" />, and thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/2/ca2f4283cfd441270cb90bfd2cf89a533f3dde81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2ef0db19f3de071176640212bf3a8c1351e4cf1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$ 90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" /> at store <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c336dbe8a9fdc3c818b891474db51892d69af1ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$ 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" /> greater than the additional <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/6/236fec243316957e078fcd0819979ff7db258a9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25\\%-15\\% = 10\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"145\" height=\"14\" /> off at store <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Thus the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b56bd637cb2c936d539be1b5000a64a898af389.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> off is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2ef0db19f3de071176640212bf3a8c1351e4cf1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$ 90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add22d9bda21e86390bc74fa4dde17730a442da7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c336dbe8a9fdc3c818b891474db51892d69af1ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$ 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/e/d5eb8726a34932d28103ce7ce17456421222603f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/3/133e8b7c528260256cd0de9f8e1c2eabbf917b28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$ 75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" />, and therefore the sticker price is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/2/362384218da12b8b25ab3a0b057a7fc5e7c6b349.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$ 750$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">